  "description": "NetworkBlaster — programmable HTTP/REST client for .NET. Sibling to AzureBlast in the Blast family. Named connections resolved through a pluggable Func<category, key, ct, Task<string>> secret resolver, so callers stay decoupled from any vault implementation (SecretBlast or otherwise).",
